%% Chat-format pattern: plain-language node names with the real file name in
%% parentheses, labels on every edge, numbers and the walkthrough in the prose
%% around the diagram. Colors carry the same meanings as the SVG template.
flowchart LR
    You["You (fill in the form and click Save)"] -- "your recipe, as a message" --> Server["The kitchen — your server (server.js)"]
    Server -- "the finished recipe" --> File["Your recipes file (recipes.json)"]
    Server -- "if something is missing: a friendly error" .-> You
    Server -- "your updated list — the page quietly asks for it" .-> You

    classDef front fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111
    classDef code fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#111
    classDef data fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#111
    class You front
    class Server code
    class File data
